            ],
            "Saved. Trustpilot reviews are fetched in the background within a minute or two; Google reviews load live on the page.": [
                "Ulo\u017eeno. Recenze ze slu\u017eby Trustpilot se na\u010d\u00edtaj\u00ed na pozad\u00ed b\u011bhem minuty nebo dvou; recenze od Google se na\u010d\u00edtaj\u00ed \u017eiv\u011b na str\u00e1nce."
            ],
            "Trustpilot reviews are fetched once a day in the background and kept on your site, so a busy page costs nothing extra on your Trustpilot account; if a refresh fails, the last reviews stay. Google does not allow its reviews to be stored, so they are loaded live when a visitor views the page: each view is one request on your own Google key, billed by Google.": [
                "Recenze z platformy Trustpilot se stahuj\u00ed jednou denn\u011b na pozad\u00ed a ukl\u00e1daj\u00ed se na v\u00e1\u0161 web, tak\u017ee vyt\u00ed\u017een\u00e1 str\u00e1nka nestoj\u00ed na va\u0161em \u00fa\u010dtu Trustpilot nic nav\u00edc; pokud se aktualizace zda\u0159it nezda\u0159\u00ed, z\u016fst\u00e1vaj\u00ed zachov\u00e1ny posledn\u00ed recenze. Spole\u010dnost Google neumo\u017e\u0148uje ukl\u00e1d\u00e1n\u00ed sv\u00fdch recenz\u00ed, proto se na\u010d\u00edtaj\u00ed \u017eiv\u011b, kdy\u017e si n\u00e1v\u0161t\u011bvn\u00edk str\u00e1nku prohl\u00ed\u017e\u00ed: ka\u017ed\u00e9 zobrazen\u00ed p\u0159edstavuje jeden po\u017eadavek na v\u00e1\u0161 vlastn\u00ed kl\u00ed\u010d od Googlu, kter\u00fd Google z\u00fa\u010dtuje."
